== Description ==
Periodically yields Void Mana based on Pet level, Hallowed Clicks performed and Void Mana earned from a single Void Entity. Increase Void Mana profits, based on Void Mana earned in this Exile.

Gains experience per second, based on Void Mana profits.

== Pet Ability ==

On ability activation (every 5 seconds), yields Void Mana, equal to:
<br><math>P^{0.25} \times L^{1.35} \times (\mathrm{pHC} + 1)^{2.5} \times \frac{E^{0.75}}{10}</math>

Multiplies Void Mana Profit by:
<br><math>(V + 1)^{0.36} \times P^{0.85} \times L^{1.25} \times \frac{1}{1\,500\,000} + 2</math>


where:
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>\mathrm{pHC} = \text{Hallowed Clicks Performed}</math>
* <math>E = \text{Void Mana per Entity}</math>
* <math>V = \text{All Void Mana this Exile}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Accrues experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left( 120 \times \log_{10}(V) + F \right) \times M</math>

This XP pool is distributed over time, at a rate each second of:
<br><math>1 + \frac{X}{10}</math>

where:
* <math>V = \text{Void Mana Profit}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>X = \text{Accrued Pet XP}</math>

